# ZLCE Studio v3.2.2 Environment Configuration
# Note: ZLCE Studio is a 100% client-side static application.
# All parsing, validation, and session states are processed in-memory
# and persisted locally via browser localStorage. No API keys are required for core features.

# Optional / External AI Studio runtime variables (if proxying API endpoints in future):
# GEMINI_API_KEY="MY_GEMINI_API_KEY"
# APP_URL="MY_APP_URL"
